Patch summary:
Export GL-only ColorBuffers as dma-bufs, for hosts without Vulkan (the
gfxstream GLES path). The translator gains eglExportDmabufImageANDROID: an
image of a GL texture is re-created as a native EGLImage of the texture's
global name and exported with the host EGL's EGL_MESA_image_dma_buf_export,
whose fd, stride, offset and modifier come back to ColorBufferGl. The
ColorBuffer's blob export falls back to it when there is no Vulkan image, and
the row pitch reported by stream_renderer_resource_get_info takes the pitch
of the last GL export when there is no Vulkan layout to ask.
